	(text "05 J1 (W17-b, 2x20 1.27 mm), rev4 pad table PROPOSED (PLAN section 4): card -> HV PWM 29-32, HV_ENABLE 38, ADC_SCK 14, ADC_CS 15, MUX_A0 11, MUX_A1 13, MUX_A2 12 (was a back channel in IF-2.2); HV -> card ADC_SDO1 17, ADC_SDO2 19, ADC_SCK_RET 16, HV_PERMIT_STAT 37. HV_PERMIT (W16) is reported only, it gates nothing (PLAN D3)."
